{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MChartier/little-say/pulls/29","id":4762202093,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU65Oyc8AAAABG9lv7Q","html_url":"https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/pull/29","diff_url":"https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/pull/29.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/pull/29.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MChartier/little-say/issues/29","number":29,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add optional accounts with private backup and restore","user":{"login":"MChartier","id":1258197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTgxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1258197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier","html_url":"https://github.com/MChartier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MChartier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFamilies currently keep boards and saved media only on each device, so reinstalling or moving devices can lose their library. This adds optional Firebase sign-in and consent-based backup to the selected server, preserving guest use, offline playback and local boards after sign-out.\n\nBackups validate media with SHA-256, preserve conflicting edits, enforce quotas and retry interrupted deletion. Browser sessions use HttpOnly cookies; native credentials use SecureStore. The accounts migration follows the landed PostgreSQL foundation. Account requests stay pinned to the consented server, including during development.\n\nCloses #19. Replaces the accounts work in #24 directly on master, without the deferred OAuth grants in #20. Those branches and their historical evidence remain preserved.\n\n## Test plan and behavior evidence\n\n| Scenario | Expected and observed result |\n| --- | --- |\n| Create an account, verify email, then sign in on a fresh browser | Explicit consent precedes backup; verification gates sync; boards and photo/picture/speech bytes restore exactly. Three real account-browser scenarios passed. |\n| Disconnect during sync, then reconnect | Local boards remain intact; reconnect completes sync. Browser tests also passed offline conflict-copy, sign-out and account/server-isolation cases. |\n| Upgrade the foundation database; corrupt media; race revisions/quotas; interrupt deletion | Prior migration ledger is preserved, unsafe writes are rejected and deletion work stays durable. All 25 PostgreSQL17/Auth-emulator contracts passed. |\n\n### Before / After\n\nBefore is actual master `842ac7f`; After is the account-only head `88fd6b0`. Matched synthetic library, fresh second-device storage, 1180×1050, scale 1, light theme and shared clock. No UI hiding or image edits. Baseline navigation differs because master has no account action.\n\n**Consent:** After explains what uploads, server access and how to continue without signing in.\n\n| Before: no account consent | After: explicit backup consent |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![Before: master Parent settings](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/5731b0dafacd0553b538c3f9d824348c75ce92b5/before-consent-unavailable.png?raw=true) | ![After: backup disclosure and consent](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/5731b0dafacd0553b538c3f9d824348c75ce92b5/after-backup-consent.png?raw=true) |\n\n**Restore:** the fresh master device has no saved boards; After restores the verified account library. Blank-looking thumbnails are deliberate tiny synthetic media; restored bytes were asserted exactly.\n\n| Before: fresh guest device | After: restored account library |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![Before: no saved boards](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/5731b0dafacd0553b538c3f9d824348c75ce92b5/before-fresh-device.png?raw=true) | ![After: Farmyard friends restored](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/5731b0dafacd0553b538c3f9d824348c75ce92b5/after-restored-device.png?raw=true) |\n\n**Recovery, both at After:** offline sync reports failure without losing boards; reconnect completes sync. This supplements the master-to-head comparisons.\n\n| After: offline failure | After: recovered |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![After: boards retained during failure](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/5731b0dafacd0553b538c3f9d824348c75ce92b5/after-offline-retry.png?raw=true) | ![After: all boards and assets synced](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/5731b0dafacd0553b538c3f9d824348c75ce92b5/after-recovered.png?raw=true) |\n\n[Immutable source/build/fixture provenance, reproduction and full scope](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/blob/5731b0dafacd0553b538c3f9d824348c75ce92b5/README.md). Nonempty actually loaded bundles matched both isolated builds.\n\n## Supporting checks and limitations\n\n[Current-head CI](https://github.com/MChartier/little-say/actions/runs/37501992018) passed. Release/type checks, 228 unit tests, 73 guest/offline browser scenarios, server/web builds and Android JavaScript export passed. Real Google/Apple authorization and hardware SecureStore remain unverified; synthetic identities and export are not provider/device proof. No provider setup or deployment is included. Actual GitHub PR-page image rendering is [human-waived](https://github.com/MChartier/calibrate-health/issues/405#issuecomment-6022754087), not verified by inspection.\n","created_at":"2026-10-06T17:14:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T22:21:58Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fa6967a4d6044abd7cd40f